      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back at Claude Monet, Chef Barinov is stunned when Malafeev walks into the dining room healthy and cheerful, having never touched the poisoned dish. Meanwhile at the hospital, Max steps into the corridor while Sasha hides under his blanket, only to run straight into Vika arriving to visit him.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Там футболист вчерашний приехал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Не бойся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Спасибо, что предупредил.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Шеф, ну, надеюсь, вы не собираете его?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
